OL,3,AFake 10 Downing Street listing exposes
OL,4,A'unfit' Booking.com, says consumer
OL,5,Agroup
OL,6,
OL,7,FConsumer group Which? says it was able
OL,8,Fto create a fake listing for 10 Downing
OL,9,FStreet on travel giant Booking.com.
OL,11,FThe UK watchdog said its researchers
OL,12,Fwere able to book a bogus stay at the
OL,13,Fprime minister's address - as well as
OL,14,Fleave a fake review noting "hanging
OL,15,Fout" with resident mouser Larry the cat
OL,16,Fas a highlight.
OL,18,FIt said despite clear signs it was
OL,19,Ffake, Booking.com did not remove the
OL,20,Flisting until two months after it was
OL,21,Fuploaded.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,113,105,200,160,0,100
